{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01VssgfNMURLPkLWhBmbsYd1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"US-058 done. Committed as `5ab1e2d`.\n\n**Summary:**\n- **Bug**: `CodeClozeWidget` rendered slot hints inside a `display: block` span below the input instead of as an end-of-line comment matching the lesson language.\n- **Fix**: Extracted pure helpers (`commentPrefix`, `findExistingCommentStart`, `formatFeedbackComment`, `groupSegmentsIntoLines`) to `src/widgets/CodeCloze/feedbackComment.ts`. Refactored `<pre>` to render line-by-line, with each line owning its own trailing feedback comment span (italic, `var(--code-comment)`). Added optional `language` field to schema (default Python `#`, JS/TS `//`).\n- **Inline-icon bug**: Discovered that `lucide-react` SVGs default to `display: block`; combined with inherited `whiteSpace: pre-wrap` from `<pre>`, the icon wrapped below the input inside the inline-block wrapper. Fixed with `whiteSpace: nowrap` on wrapper + `display: inline-block` on icon.\n- **Quality**: typecheck clean, 248/248 tests (was 225, +23 new), 15/15 playwright assertions on `/courses/cloze-test/lessons/box-blur`."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":405,"cache_read_input_tokens":141360,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":405},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ae8df7de-da98-42e4-9412-547c888ddf87","uuid":"708a64a3-0f29-407d-b7ec-741d20227cc1"}
